abstract: >-
  SkillOps (npx skillops-cli@latest) is a 100% offline, zero-API Node.js 20+ and TypeScript platform
  that eliminates Startup Token Tax bloat and implicit semantic routing collapse across the Top 20
  AI coding agents, IDEs, and CLI harnesses. It pairs a 3-level progressive disclosure linter,
  TF-IDF/MinHash semantic collision auditor, context-aware repository fingerprinter, universal 20-harness
  transpiler, and JSON-RPC 2.0 stdio Model Context Protocol (MCP) server with a benchmark-verified catalog
  of Hybrid Executable Skills (SKILL.md + deterministic Python 3.12+ AST/CLI tools + comparative
  with_skill vs. without_skill TDD evaluations) and Context-Isolated Subagents.
